  "changes": [
    "Selected twenty-three casino engines and their shared helpers; other games and upstream web services are not included.",
    "Cryptographic shuffle replaces math/rand; Pair Plus winnings on Fold credited.",
    "Action logs copy card slices instead of mutating past deal records.",
    "Normalized stakes (1000 chips, 100 for Crazy 4 and Free Bet, five for Deuces Wild) preserve rational payouts. These chips never become a user balance.",
    "Royal owns account authorization, all money, hidden persistent snapshots, reservations and action idempotency. Reset and arbitrary chip balances are never exposed.",
    "Royal screens use text playing cards; no upstream artwork or trademarks are imported. Comment punctuation follows the Royal convention.",
    "Round-level completion adapters for Crazy 4 and Free Bet; multihand Blackjack views; per-card exchange fees; Andar Bahar retains its revealed key card after the initial wager."
  ]
